femticPy patch 0005-meshgen-number-format

Rationale: MeshGen wrote table values with '%4.1f'/'%4.3f': oblateness 0.952 became 1.0 (a zero-thickness ellipsoid), 0.35 became 0.3, and INTERPOLATE's point count '3.0' shifted epsilon to 0; use %.10g/%d.

--- a/src/femticPy.py
+++ b/src/femticPy.py
@@ -730,7 +730,7 @@
